   "RaceName": "Tacoma Municipal Court Pos. 3",
   "Statement": "<b>Occupation</b><br>Judge, Tacoma Municipal Court<br><br><b>Education</b><br>JD, University of Puget Sound; BA, Rutgers University; Army JAG School; Army Command and General's Staff School; National Defense University<br><br><b>Statement</b><br>It has been my privilege to serve this City as Judge. When I last ran, I pledged that I would bring compassionate accountability to the court. With the implementation of our community and mental health courts and our comprehensive therapeutic justice approach, I have met this goal. These programs have made our city safer, cut down on reoffenders, held people accountable and changed lives. I pledge to work with my colleagues, our civic partners and the public to continue to improve our court. My goals for the future include the creation of pre-trial and post-trial supervision programs and the further automation of court systems. Please allow me to continue to use my over three decades of legal, leadership and organizational skills by giving me your vote. Thank you.&nbsp;</p><p> ",
